From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TEX8 Wallet Team <wallet@tex8.local>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 20:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] wallet-cli: require signed Worker acceptance receipt

Keep hosted enrollment pending after the Relay queues the ciphertext. Persist
its opaque message identifier, poll the descriptor-owned receipt endpoint and
verify the exact Worker's online-key signature before committing active.

Migrate V1 hosted sidecars fail-closed: an old Relay-accepted record is
resubmitted and an old active record must be resealed before it can become
active again. No receipt, identifier, key or ciphertext is printed.
